---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Terms and Conditions | Legacy Moving Denver";
const description = "Terms and conditions for using Legacy Moving Denver website and services. Moving quotes are estimates and may change based on final assessment.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="container py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto prose prose-lg">
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-6 text-secondary">
        Terms and Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8">
        Last Updated: January 23, 2026
      </p>

      <p>
        Welcome to Legacy Moving Denver's website. By accessing and using this website (www.legacymovingdenver.com), you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and conditions outlined below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">1. Use of Website</h2>
      <p>
        This website is provided for informational purposes about Legacy Moving Denver's moving services. You may use this website to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Learn about our moving services</li>
        <li>Request moving quotes</li>
        <li>Contact us for information</li>
        <li>View our service areas and pricing information</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">2. Moving Quotes and Estimates</h2>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">2.1 Quote Validity</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>All quotes provided through this website or over the phone are estimates only.</strong> Final pricing may vary based on:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Actual size and weight of items being moved</li>
        <li>Distance between origin and destination</li>
        <li>Accessibility of both locations (stairs, elevators, parking, etc.)</li>
        <li>Time required to complete the move</li>
        <li>Additional services requested (packing, specialty items, storage)</li>
        <li>Unforeseen circumstances or obstacles</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">2.2 No Obligation</h3>
      <p>
        Requesting a quote through this website does not create any obligation on your part to book our services, nor does it obligate Legacy Moving Denver to provide services at the quoted price without a formal written agreement.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">2.3 Quote Changes</h3>
      <p>
        Quotes may change at any time based on availability, seasonal demand, and current pricing. A quote is only guaranteed once confirmed in writing and a deposit (if required) has been received.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">3. Form Submissions and Contact</h2>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">3.1 Contact Permission</h3>
      <p>
        By filling out and submitting any form on this website (including quote request forms, contact forms, or feedback forms), you expressly consent to Legacy Moving Denver contacting you via:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Phone calls (including automated/prerecorded calls)</li>
        <li>Text messages/SMS</li>
        <li>Email</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This consent applies to the phone number and email address you provide, even if that number is on a Do Not Call registry.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">3.2 Information Accuracy</h3>
      <p>
        You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information when submitting forms. We are not responsible for issues arising from inaccurate information provided by you.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">3.3 Response Time</h3>
      <p>
        We strive to respond to all inquiries within 24 business hours, but response times may vary depending on volume and availability.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">4. Service Terms</h2>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">4.1 Licensing and Insurance</h3>
      <p>
        Legacy Moving Denver is fully licensed (DOT #3462023, MC #1189363, PUC #HHG-00682) and insured. Specific coverage details and limitations will be provided in your service agreement.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">4.2 Service Agreement</h3>
      <p>
        Actual moving services are governed by a separate service agreement that will be provided before service commences. That agreement, not this website, controls the terms of the actual moving service.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">4.3 Service Areas</h3>
      <p>
        We primarily serve the Denver metro area including Denver, Aurora, Lakewood, Arvada, Westminster, Thornton, Centennial, Highlands Ranch, Littleton, Englewood, Golden, and Boulder. Service to areas outside our standard service area may be subject to additional fees or may not be available.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">5. Website Content</h2>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">5.1 Information Accuracy</h3>
      <p>
        While we strive to keep information on this website accurate and up-to-date, we make no representations or warranties of any kind about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or availability of the website or the information contained on the website.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">5.2 Changes to Website</h3>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any aspect of this website at any time without notice.
      </p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mt-6 mb-3">5.3 Intellectual Property</h3>
      <p>
        All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, images, and software, is the property of Legacy Moving Denver and protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>To the fullest extent permitted by law:</strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>This website is provided "as is" without any warranties of any kind</li>
        <li>Legacy Moving Denver shall not be liable for any damages arising from use of this website</li>
        <li>We are not responsible for any decisions made based solely on information from this website</li>
        <li>Any reliance on material from this website is at your own risk</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">7. External Links</h2>
      <p>
        This website may contain links to external websites (such as review sites, social media, etc.). We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or terms of use of external websites.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">8. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Colorado. Any disputes arising from use of this website shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Colorado.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to update these terms and conditions at any time without prior notice. Your continued use of the website after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 text-secondary">10. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us:
      </p>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg mt-4">
        <p class="mb-2"><strong>Legacy Moving Denver</strong></p>
        <p class="mb-2">8805 W. 14th Ave, Suite 300</p>
        <p class="mb-2">Lakewood, CO 80215</p>
        <p class="mb-2">Phone: <a href="tel:7203401849" class="text-primary hover:underline">(720) 340-1849</a></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@legacymovingdenver.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@legacymovingdenver.com</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 rounded">
        <p class="font-semibold text-secondary mb-2">⚠️ Important Notice</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          By using this website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use this website.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
